{
  "_comment": [
    "COPY THIS TO credentials.json AND FILL IN. credentials.json is gitignored (.gitignore:58),",
    "as are *.p12, *.p8 and *.mobileprovision. Never commit the real file.",
    "",
    "The paths below point OUTSIDE every repo, matching the Android keystore convention.",
    "The owner places the files there and writes the password into credentials.json directly --",
    "the password is never pasted into chat and no agent ever sees it.",
    "",
    "D-35: this file existing is what keeps EAS from managing remote credentials, which is the",
    "only path that can raise a revoke-or-regenerate prompt. Both production and preview are",
    "pinned to credentialsSource: local in eas.json."
  ],
